1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,450
Emperor. General. Conqueror.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,950
And famously... tiny.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,450
Except he wasn't.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,950
He was about five foot seven.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,450
Average for a Frenchman. Maybe taller.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,950
His autopsy said five foot two.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,450
But in French inches.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,950
A French inch was longer.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,450
Nobody checked.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,950
Then British cartoonists got involved.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,450
James Gillray drew him as a tantrum-throwing toddler.

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,950
Britain loved it.

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,450
"I am a normal size."

14
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,950
"Sure you are."

15
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,450
His elite guards were picked for height.

16
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,950
His troops called him "the little corporal."

17
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,450
Affectionately. Nobody checked.

18
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,950
Historians still argue over the units.

19
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,450
Most say French.

20
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,950
Two hundred years later... nobody checked.
